nd host together:\n• Add cohosts so friends and family can join in on the fun, invite guests and share updates.\n• Sync events to Calendar automatically so you can easily keep track of what’s coming up.\n• Post messages in the event to keep everyone up to date on last-minute details.\n\nInvite and manage RSVPs:\n• Invite others with just a link using any messaging platform.\n• Guests can RSVP in the iPhone app or on the web from any device.\n• Build anticipation with the countdown widget on your Home Screen.\n\nFuel the party with Music and relive it with Photos:\n• Add a collaborative playlist so guests get to hear their favourite songs at the party.\n• Include a Shared Album so everyone can add photos and relive all the best moments from the event.\n\nRequirements:\n• Apple Invites is available for all iPhone models with iOS 18 or later.\n• Ability to collaborate with Apple Music Playlists requires an Apple Music subscription.\n• Anyone can reply to invitations. Creation of invitations requires an iCloud+ subscription.","bundleId":"com.apple.rsvp","sellerName":"Apple Distribution International","genreIds":["6012"],"isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"userRatingCount":145}